    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">RegulatoryDesignCriterion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Criterion of the comparative taxonomy of Alanoca et al. (FAccT 2025, doi:10.1145/3715275.3732059), with its original definition, or one of the declared extensions E1-E7. The concepts themselves live in the comparative module.</rdfs:comment>
